    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/on97X5TCK54arKma2zxcmrlZp_wpNv-ZITyDmpt8iQk.original.fullsize.png\">\nIf $n(X)={ }^m C_6$, then the value of $m$ is",
